<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  ============================================================================
  WildAnimals_Sump.xml                      UtinniPatches — new file 2026-09-25
  ============================================================================
  Wires the biome's one seated canon Star Wars beast — RSW_Hssiss — onto
  RM_TheSump's own wildAnimals, per Q11a: a genuine canon name is IP and must
  route through the Utinni patch layer, never live inline in the franchise-
  free RM_ tier def. THESUMP_RM_MOD_BUILD_1 §3/§5 and SUMP_UTINNI_LAYER_1 §3
  both name this exact file/weight.

  🔑 SOURCE OF TRUTH: design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/rosters/the_sump.json's
  "fauna" array — Hssiss, commonality 0.18, action "import", ruled 2026-09-10
  ("the Sump move STANDS — tar-sleeper, partial-remains register; Miasma
  reading rejected"). Already ported and used live at this exact weight in
  WildAnimals_Greentide.xml:172 (src/RimStarWars/SWBestiary/Defs/ThingDefs_Races/
  RSW_Hssiss.xml is the real def) — this file follows that exact precedent
  (WildAnimals_Pyrelands.xml's own RSW_ block, read in full before writing
  this), same shorthand-dictionary form RM_TheSump_Biome.xml's own wildAnimals
  already uses.

  Gate: PatchOperationConditional (silent no-op if RM_TheSump is ever absent)
  wrapping a PatchOperationAdd, MayRequire="mandrake.rsw.swbestiary" on the
  whole Operation — the real source mod for RSW_Hssiss, not the donor
  "Star Wars Animal Collection (Continued)" (Anooba/Iriaz/etc.'s own mod);
  Hssiss is one of THIS repo's own SWBestiary ports, so the gate is our own
  packageId, matching every other RSW_-tier reference in this repo.

  ⚠️ A patch that matches nothing logs nothing (PatchOperationConditional
  returns true on no match) — validate with
  skills/rimworld-modding/scripts/validate_patch.py against the live def dump
  once mandrake.rm.thesump is deployed and active.
  ============================================================================
-->
<Patch>

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional" MayRequire="mandrake.rsw.swbestiary">
    <xpath>Defs/BiomeDef[defName="RM_TheSump"]/wildAnimals</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
      <xpath>Defs/BiomeDef[defName="RM_TheSump"]/wildAnimals</xpath>
      <value>
        <RSW_Hssiss>0.18</RSW_Hssiss>
      </value>
    </match>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
